flowchart TD
    A[Describe workload and SLO] --> B[Check CPU memory accelerator and architecture]
    B --> C[Check eligible NodePools and capacity types]
    C --> D[Check AZ and hostname placement together]
    D --> E[Check startup readiness and workload priority]
    E --> F[Check storage and network dependencies]
    F --> G[Check voluntary disruption and recovery budgets]
    G --> H{All requirements compatible?}
    H -->|Yes| I[Review complete manifest and validation evidence]
    H -->|No| J[Revise constraints or capacity]
    J --> B
